sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant C as Customer
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant ES as Escrow Service
    participant DS as Dispute Service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant M as Merchant
    participant ADM as Admin
    participant PO as Payout Service

    Note over C,PO: ── DISPUTE FLOW ──

    %% Customer raises dispute
    C->>AG: POST /disputes { escrowRef, reason, description }
    AG->>ES: Route (JWT validated)
    ES->>ES: Validate status=DELIVERED & within window
    ES->>ES: Update status → DISPUTED
    ES->>DS: Create dispute record (status=OPEN)
    DS->>DS: Set response_deadline = now + 24hrs
    ES->>MQ: Publish escrow.disputed
    ES->>MQ: Publish audit.event (diff via DiffAuditHelper)

    MQ->>NS: escrow.disputed event
    NS->>M: Email+SMS: "Dispute raised. Respond within 24hrs"
    NS->>ADM: Alert: "New dispute — TXN-YYYY-XXXXXX"
    NS->>C: Email: "Dispute received. Review within 48hrs"

    %% Customer uploads evidence
    C->>AG: POST /disputes/{id}/evidence (file upload)
    AG->>DS: Route request
    DS->>DS: Validate file type & size (< 10MB)
    DS->>DS: Upload to Cloudinary, save evidence record
    DS-->>C: 201 Evidence uploaded

    %% Merchant responds
    M->>AG: POST /disputes/{id}/merchant-response
    AG->>DS: Route (API key validated)
    DS->>DS: Save merchant response, mark merchant_responded=true
    DS->>MQ: Publish dispute.merchant_responded
    MQ->>NS: Notify customer + admin

    %% Merchant uploads counter-evidence
    M->>AG: POST /disputes/{id}/evidence (tracking proof, photos)
    AG->>DS: Route request
    DS->>DS: Upload to Cloudinary, save evidence record
    DS-->>M: 201 Evidence uploaded

    %% Admin reviews & resolves
    ADM->>AG: PUT /admin/disputes/{id}/resolve
    Note right of ADM: resolution=RESOLVED_CUSTOMER<br/>resolutionNote="Item not as described"
    AG->>DS: Route (ADMIN role required)
    DS->>DS: Update dispute status → RESOLVED_CUSTOMER
    DS->>ES: Update escrow status → RESOLVED_CUSTOMER
    DS->>MQ: Publish escrow.resolved.customer
    DS->>MQ: Publish audit.event (diff via DiffAuditHelper)

    %% Refund to customer
    MQ->>PO: escrow.resolved.customer event
    PO->>PO: Initiate refund via Interswitch Refund API
    PO->>PO: Save payout record (type=CUSTOMER_REFUND)
    PO->>MQ: Publish payout.refunded
    MQ->>NS: payout.refunded event

    NS->>C: Email: "Dispute resolved in your favour. Refund of ₦862,750 initiated."
    NS->>M: Email: "Dispute resolved in customer's favour. Ref: TXN-YYYY-XXXXXX"

    Note over C,PO: ── END: Customer refunded ──
